00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.769
making a political or ideological point.

00:00:20.419 --> 00:00:24.829
They may also be involved in espionage
either industrial or state sponsored.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.570
They may even do it because they
can and show the world their skills.

00:00:29.369 --> 00:00:33.380
Abraham: They mainly involve outside
entities or but can also involve

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.980
insider threats attacks from disgruntled
employees or covert threat actors.

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:43.790
Nicole: All sectors are vulnerable to
cyber-attack but he key sectors most

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.670
vulnerable are businesses, healthcare,
government, Energy and education.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:53.540
We all hear about the high-profile attacks
on media companies like Netflix and

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.900
Sony and many on financial institutions.

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:03.540
For companies like this cyber security is
looked on as key to their systems however

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:07.429
smaller businesses and organisations
are probably more susceptible.

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:13.920
Abraham: Healthcare organisations offer
